//     QdrantClient in internal/legacy/qdrant.go talks to it over gRPC
//     (6334) — no mock on the legacy-Qdrant side.
//
//   - A bufconn-backed in-process gRPC server hosting stub
//     implementations of every files-svc service the migrator
//     calls (EntityType, RelationshipType, Corpus, Document, Entity,
//     Edge). Each Migrate*/Bootstrap RPC mints a deterministic UUID
//     keyed on the legacy_id (uuid.NewSHA1(uuid.NameSpaceURL, …)) and
//     stores the row in an in-memory map. Re-runs return
//     already_migrated=true with the same UUID. Get RPCs return the
//     stored row so reconcile's deep-spot-check has real data to
